<div id="rcr">
<div id="rcr-main">
<div class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="heading-1">Make one honest video.<br>Earn on every sale it drives.</h1>
    <p class="sub body-3 muted">We send you a Reviv for free. You film your real experience. We put real ad money behind your video and pay you 5% of every sale it brings in.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg button-md" href="#creators">Watch our creators</a>
    </div>
    <div class="flags caption-5">
      <span class="pill">United States</span><span class="pill">United Kingdom</span><span class="pill">Australia</span><span class="pill new">India &middot; new</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wall" aria-label="Creator videos">
    <div class="row" id="row1"></div>
    <div class="row r2" id="row2"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><b class="heading-3">100,000+</b><span class="body-6 muted">Revivs sold worldwide</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b class="heading-3" id="nCreators">22</b><span class="body-6 muted">creators with their own Reviv page</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b class="heading-3" id="nClips">140+</b><span class="body-6 muted">creator videos running as ads</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b class="heading-3">4</b><span class="body-6 muted">countries, India is the newest</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="deal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rise">
      <h2 class="heading-2">You make the video.<br>We make it work.</h2>
      <p class="body-3 muted">Most brand deals pay once and disappear. With Reviv your video keeps earning for as long as our ads keep running it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="deal">
      <div class="card rise">
        <p class="title-3 muted">Start here</p>
        <div class="big">Free Reviv</div>
        <p class="body-3 muted">Pick your guard. We ship it to you, no charge, no strings on what you say about it.</p>
        <ul class="body-6">
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="#D4A24C" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.7 77.7l-128 128a8 8 0 0 1-11.4 0l-56-56a8 8 0 0 1 11.4-11.4L96 188.7 218.3 66.3a8 8 0 0 1 11.4 11.4Z"/></svg><span>Use it, then give your honest review</span></li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="#D4A24C" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.7 77.7l-128 128a8 8 0 0 1-11.4 0l-56-56a8 8 0 0 1 11.4-11.4L96 188.7 218.3 66.3a8 8 0 0 1 11.4 11.4Z"/></svg><span>Your words, your style, your honest take</span></li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="#D4A24C" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.7 77.7l-128 128a8 8 0 0 1-11.4 0l-56-56a8 8 0 0 1 11.4-11.4L96 188.7 218.3 66.3a8 8 0 0 1 11.4 11.4Z"/></svg><span>A personal discount code for your followers</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card rise">
        <p class="title-3 muted">Then keep earning</p>
        <div class="big">5% of every sale</div>
        <p class="body-3 muted">When we run your video as an ad from your handle, you earn 5% of every sale that ad brings in.</p>
        <ul class="body-6">
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="#D4A24C" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.7 77.7l-128 128a8 8 0 0 1-11.4 0l-56-56a8 8 0 0 1 11.4-11.4L96 188.7 218.3 66.3a8 8 0 0 1 11.4 11.4Z"/></svg><span>We pay for the ads, you never spend a rupee</span></li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="#D4A24C" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.7 77.7l-128 128a8 8 0 0 1-11.4 0l-56-56a8 8 0 0 1 11.4-11.4L96 188.7 218.3 66.3a8 8 0 0 1 11.4 11.4Z"/></svg><span>Your handle on the ad, so your account grows too</span></li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="#D4A24C" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.7 77.7l-128 128a8 8 0 0 1-11.4 0l-56-56a8 8 0 0 1 11.4-11.4L96 188.7 218.3 66.3a8 8 0 0 1 11.4 11.4Z"/></svg><span>Results shared with you every month</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rise">
      <h2 class="heading-2">Three steps, nothing complicated</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step rise"><div class="n title-3">1</div><h3 class="heading-5">Reply to our message</h3><p class="body-6 muted">Answer the Instagram DM we sent you. We ask your size so the guard fits, then ship it.</p></div>
      <div class="step rise"><div class="n title-3">2</div><h3 class="heading-5">Use it, then review</h3><p class="body-6 muted">Use it and film your review: what you noticed about your sleep, jaw, face or routine. Phone camera is perfect.</p></div>
      <div class="step rise"><div class="n title-3">3</div><h3 class="heading-5">We run it, you earn</h3><p class="body-6 muted">You approve it as a partnership ad on Instagram. We put budget behind it and you earn 5% of every sale.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="creators">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rise">
      <h2 class="heading-2">Real people, real routines</h2>
      <p class="body-3 muted">Tap any creator to watch their videos. Many of them got their own page on our store, built around their story.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter creators">
      <button class="chip body-5" aria-pressed="true" data-f="all">All</button>
      <button class="chip body-5" aria-pressed="false" data-f="face">Face and jaw</button>
      <button class="chip body-5" aria-pressed="false" data-f="sleep">Sleep and grinding</button>
      <button class="chip body-5" aria-pressed="false" data-f="pain">TMJ and headaches</button>
    </div>
    <div class="grid" id="grid"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="heading-1" id="tagline">Your honest video, backed by our ad budget, earning you money every time it sells.</h2>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rise">
      <h2 class="heading-2">Before you reply</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details class="rise"><summary class="title-2">Do I need a big following?<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224 128a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-80v80a8 8 0 0 1-16 0v-80H40a8 8 0 0 1 0-16h80V40a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v80h80a8 8 0 0 1 8 8Z"/></svg></summary><p class="body-6 muted">No. We care about how real your video feels, not your follower count. Plenty of our best performing ads come from accounts with a few thousand followers.</p></details>
      <details class="rise"><summary class="title-2">What does it cost me?<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224 128a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-80v80a8 8 0 0 1-16 0v-80H40a8 8 0 0 1 0-16h80V40a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v80h80a8 8 0 0 1 8 8Z"/></svg></summary><p class="body-6 muted">Nothing. The guard is free and we pay for every ad. You only give us your time and an honest video.</p></details>
      <details class="rise"><summary class="title-2">How does the 5% work?<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224 128a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-80v80a8 8 0 0 1-16 0v-80H40a8 8 0 0 1 0-16h80V40a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v80h80a8 8 0 0 1 8 8Z"/></svg></summary><p class="body-6 muted">When your video runs as a partnership ad from your handle, every sale that ad brings in earns you 5%. We share the results with you every month and pay out what you earned.</p></details>
      <details class="rise"><summary class="title-2">Do I have to say good things?<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224 128a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-80v80a8 8 0 0 1-16 0v-80H40a8 8 0 0 1 0-16h80V40a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v80h80a8 8 0 0 1 8 8Z"/></svg></summary><p class="body-6 muted">No. Use it, then give your honest review. Honest videos are the ones that sell, so that is what we want.</p></details>
      <details class="rise"><summary class="title-2">What is a partnership ad?<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224 128a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-80v80a8 8 0 0 1-16 0v-80H40a8 8 0 0 1 0-16h80V40a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v80h80a8 8 0 0 1 8 8Z"/></svg></summary><p class="body-6 muted">An Instagram ad that shows your handle and your video, paid for by us. You approve it from your Instagram settings and can see it running.</p></details>
      <details class="rise"><summary class="title-2">What kind of video should I make?<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224 128a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-80v80a8 8 0 0 1-16 0v-80H40a8 8 0 0 1 0-16h80V40a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v80h80a8 8 0 0 1 8 8Z"/></svg></summary><p class="body-6 muted">Talk to camera about what you noticed: your sleep, your jaw, your face, your mornings. Show the guard. Thirty to sixty seconds filmed on your phone is ideal.</p></details>
      <details class="rise"><summary class="title-2">Which Reviv will I get?<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224 128a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-80v80a8 8 0 0 1-16 0v-80H40a8 8 0 0 1 0-16h80V40a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v80h80a8 8 0 0 1 8 8Z"/></svg></summary><p class="body-6 muted">We will match you to the right guard for your bite once you reply with your size.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card rise">
      <h2 class="heading-2">Be one of our first creators in India</h2>
      <p class="body-3 muted">We are starting with a small group. Interested? Just reply to the Instagram message we sent you and we will take it from there.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</div>



